{"v":4,"catch":"NEOGEO POCKET COLOR的RPG遊戲『BIOMOTOR UNITRON』在Nintendo Switch登場！","desc":"規模壯大的科幻RPG遊戲！\n用最強的人型戰鬥機器人「UNITRON」打敗強大的敵人！\n\n■玩家作為Unitron的駕駛員探索世界！攻略隨機變換的地牢，獲得各種材料吧！\n\n■Unitron的形態會依據駕駛員的等級而變化！通過組合材料和零件來還可以開發新的武器！創造你的專屬Unitron！\n\n■在Unitron大師的名人堂和競技場於最強的敵人進行戰鬥！成為最強的Unitron就能贏得「大師中的大師」的光榮稱號！\n\n※遊戲中收錄的手冊來自NEOGEO POCKET COLOR版本。因此，在Nintendo Switch上有一部分操作不同。\n※不支持「交換」的功能。","publisher":"SNK","release":"2022-05-26","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e883efd55694ca728702fdf4c3e5bb8b0ba6b4a9101dad21f0bbadefd4f4c780.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b69d7fe280cadda35fad52f4c6ac7121a5df517dc2bfa9d6b8942db902f980eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7593f9fbe2ad13301de5aadbfb4dca8495fd0271a58466c85b3fce01ab2e5738.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e81500f4d7dde72c10a554cc80428097b31943053fec58dfc7d5f3481820395.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9fe7eddb682d4103de091f8e7c8d3f04ae9c53fc7efbae7f65695f9b32a3cf8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f72233ef6883a16ed831823097a2b50e15f7200e93d71b2cebd0974d926e66d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c68016136000","dlc":[]}